  "title": "“Regulatory Readiness is Built Early” and Other Lessons for CGT Developers",
  "summary": "Advanced therapy developers are used to making hard decisions under pressure. In early development, the priority is often clear: reach the clinic, generate meaningful data, and keep the program moving. This was the central theme of the recent webinar, “Prevent Advanced Therapy Program Delays with Early Supply Chain Strategy.” The expert panel explored why early supply chain decisions deserve strategic attention long before a program reaches pivotal trials or filing preparation.",
